                <pb facs="0317" n="205" sameAs="frus:frus1919Russia/pg205"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">861.00/4786: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Reinsch</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Acting Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date
                            ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-document-content" calendar="gregorian"
                            notAfter="1919-07-02T14:05:00-05:00"
                            notBefore="1919-06-29T12:00:00+04:53"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >undated</hi></date>.<lb/>[Received July 2, 1919, 2:05
                        p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>Following from [Harris at] Omsk.</p>
                <p>“290. June 29, noon. Perm is being evacuated by Siberian Army. Harris.”</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Reinsch</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
